{"h":"<h2><strong>[v2.0] image_qwen_image_edit_2511_Qwen 多角度相机工作流程</strong></h2><p><strong>灵活强大的多角度视觉增强控制</strong></p><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/jtydhr88/ComfyUI-qwenmultiangle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong><u>https://github.com/jtydhr88/ComfyUI-qwenmultiangle</u></strong></a></h3><p>3D图形相机控制界面节点提供直观的操作</p><p><strong>在ComfyUI Manager中搜索“Qwen Multiangle Camera”并安装</strong></p><p><strong>或</strong></p><p><strong>安装自定义缺失节点</strong></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/33f395f39a1c006d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/4cf38af5fdce7b5d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/fal/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Multiple-Angles-LoRA/tree/main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><u>Qwen-图像-编辑-2511-多角度-LoRA</u></a></h3><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/1597cd303e2d8755.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><strong><em>Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 的多角度相机控制 LoRA</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>96 个摄像机位置</em></strong><strong><em>• 经过 3000 多个高斯泼溅渲染的训练</em></strong></p><h2><strong>[v1.0] image_qwen_image_edit_2511_CC 工作流程</strong></h2><p>从官方工作流程中添加了以下内容：</p><p>在 i2i 编辑图像与 T2i 和摄像机控制提示生成器之间切换</p><p><strong>编辑图像选择（必须从图像1中选择）</strong></p><p><strong>在 T2i 模式下绕过所有图像</strong></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/073dcd1698d73d2d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><strong>摄像机控制提示生成器</strong></p><p>qwen_image_edit_2511 集成新颖的视图合成</p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/82fd22ecc0235657.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>这里使用的模型</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning/tree/main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-主闪电</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning/resolve/main/qwen_image_edit_2511_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled_lightning_comfyui_4steps_v1.0.safetensors?download=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">qwen_image_edit_2511_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled_lightning_comfyui_4steps_v1.0.safetensors</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/blob/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">qwen_image_vae.safetensors</a></p></li></ul><p>工作流程中未使用的模型</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning/resolve/main/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors</a></p></li></ul><p>使用自定义节点</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy#----rgthree-comfy--------making-comfyui-more-comfortable----\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/mercu-lore/-Multiple-Angle-Camera-Control#camera-control--relighting-prompt-nodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/mercu-lore/-Multiple-Angle-Camera-Controls</a></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":"[object Object]"}